b_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857430/extras/83bc7e682374e88b38b915ec1753a11f.avif?t=1752723319\" width=800 height=381 /></span></p>",
